Terminals unused in grammar

    ERRO


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: declaration_list

    2 declaration_list: declaration_list declaration
    3                 | declaration

    4 declaration: var_declaration
    5            | fun_declaration

    6 var_declaration: type_specifier ID SEMICOLON
    7                | type_specifier ID ABRECOLCHETES NUM FECHACOLCHETES SEMICOLON

    8 type_specifier: INT
    9               | VOID

   10 fun_declaration: type_specifier fun_id ABREPARENTESES params FECHAPARENTESES compound_decl

   11 fun_id: ID

   12 params: param_list
   13       | VOID

   14 param_list: param_list COMMA param
   15           | param

   16 param: type_specifier ID
   17      | type_specifier ID ABRECOLCHETES FECHACOLCHETES

   18 compound_decl: ABRECHAVES local_declarations statement_list FECHACHAVES

   19 local_declarations: local_declarations var_declaration
   20                   | ε

   21 statement_list: statement_list statement
   22               | ε

   23 statement: expression_decl
   24          | compound_decl
   25          | selection_decl
   26          | iteration_decl
   27          | return_decl

   28 expression_decl: expression SEMICOLON
   29                | SEMICOLON

   30 selection_decl: IF ABREPARENTESES expression FECHAPARENTESES statement
   31               | IF ABREPARENTESES expression FECHAPARENTESES statement ELSE statement

   32 iteration_decl: WHILE ABREPARENTESES expression FECHAPARENTESES statement

   33 return_decl: RETURN SEMICOLON
   34            | RETURN expression SEMICOLON

   35 expression: var ATRIB expression
   36           | simple_expression

   37 var: ID
   38    | ID ABRECOLCHETES expression FECHACOLCHETES

   39 simple_expression: simple_expression relational sum_expression
   40                  | sum_expression

   41 relational: relational_operand

   42 relational_operand: EQ
   43                   | NEQ
   44                   | LT
   45                   | GT
   46                   | LET
   47                   | GET

   48 sum_expression: sum_expression sum term
   49               | term

   50 sum: SOMA
   51    | SUB

   52 term: term mult factor
   53     | factor

   54 mult: MULT
   55     | DIV

   56 factor: ABREPARENTESES expression FECHAPARENTESES
   57       | var
   58       | activation
   59       | NUM

   60 activation: fun_id ABREPARENTESES args FECHAPARENTESES

   61 args: arg_list
   62     | ε

   63 arg_list: arg_list COMMA expression
   64         | expression


